# Hyprland keybindings

Generated by workstation-arch (roles/hyprland) from the same settings as
the binds, so it lists exactly what is bound on this machine. **{{ M }}** is
the main modifier; Caps Lock is an extra Ctrl. Every other app
(Thunderbird, Obsidian, Planify, ...) starts from the launcher.

## Apps and widgets

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ M }} + Space` | App launcher / OS menu - type to search apps and menu entries |
| `{{ M }} + Return` | Terminal (Ghostty) |
| `{{ M }} + A` | Night light on/off (warm colors, hyprsunset) |
| `{{ M }} + B` | Chromium / web browser (focus if open) |
| `{{ M }} + D` | Bitwarden (focus if open) |
| `{{ M }} + E` | Timer popup on/off (a running timer keeps running) |
| `{{ M }} + F` | Files (Nautilus) |
| `{{ M }} + G` | WhatsApp (focus if open) |
| `{{ M }} + R` | LocalSend (focus if open) |
| `{{ M }} + S` | Scratchpad: four quick notes (Alt+1..4 switch, Escape closes) |
| `{{ M }} + T` | This cheatsheet (Tab: Neovim keys) |
{% if clipboard_history_enabled %}
| `{{ M }} + V` | Clipboard history |
{% endif %}
{% if lock_idle_enabled %}
| `{{ M }} + Y` | Coffee on/off (no idle lock or screen-off; `{{ M }} + Delete` still locks) |
{% endif %}

## Windows

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ M }} + H / J / K / L` (or arrows) | Focus left / down / up / right |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + H / J / K / L` | Move window left / down / up / right |
| `{{ M }} + {{ R }} + H / L` | Resize: narrower / wider (100 px) |
| `{{ M }} + {{ R }} + K / J` | Resize: shorter / taller (100 px) |
| `{{ M }} + Q` | Close window |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + F` | Fullscreen |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + G` | Toggle floating / tiling |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + D` | Toggle horizontal / vertical split |
| `{{ M }} + left mouse drag` | Move a floating window |
| `{{ M }} + right mouse drag` | Resize a floating window |

## Workspaces

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ M }} + 1 ... 9` | Switch to workspace 1-9 |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + 1 ... 9` | Move window to workspace 1-9 |
{% if screenshots_enabled %}

## Screenshots

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `{{ M }} + X` | Drag a region or click a window -> PNG + clipboard |
| `{{ M }} + Shift + X` | The whole focused monitor |
{% if screenshots_ocr_enabled %}
| `{{ M }} + Ctrl + X` | OCR: selection -> text to the clipboard |
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

## System

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
{% if lock_idle_enabled %}
| `{{ M }} + Delete` | Lock |
{% endif %}
{% if power_menu_enabled %}
| `{{ M }} + Escape` | Power menu (lock, suspend, logout, reboot, shutdown): type to search, Up/Down wrap |
{% endif %}

## Media and hardware keys

Also on the lock screen; volume and brightness repeat while held.

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| Volume up / down | Output volume +5 % / -5 % |
| Mute / mic mute | Mute output / microphone |
| Brightness up / down | Screen brightness +5 % / -5 % |
| Play, pause / next / previous | Media player (MPRIS) |

## This window

| Key | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Tab` | Hyprland / Neovim document |
| `j` / `k` | Scroll down / up |
| `/` | Search, `Enter` jumps to the first hit |
| `n` / `N` | Next / previous hit |
| `Esc` | Clear the search, then close |
